        "232",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e533e7a99a612d0451f01cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放心下来后，感觉好累。……不过，今天\n我也许可以，稍微表扬一下自己了吧……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ab686e4e7ddea923f96d52c85f296a25f469a579119d4b5381c50037e0a588",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fa0b89619e903fe8a42dbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，再多夸夸我吧～！！\n这样我就能更加努力了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "287333b77e0c403c78ab291f8d82b0cf5e4d21e18fca1454ce82b7eca62370a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95989e8aae9908edb3b06040",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，对吧？\n这光芒可不输给迪拜的夜景哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18986ee19b123b0486353740d3f498cc36ef9df4a1f774f990ad069acdb59f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42588d23bb3513b6633b9345",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "锻炼身体之类的！　如果一直吃甜食\n会被训练员亲骂的哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0549bac33ac7ab2ca48e3d9105014b4a5048e6b94bc31c38ac85eb31dee251d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9d3364ae901bf0ba25b9a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然那个常买的牌子的包包也不错，\n但最棒的还是来自大家的～……♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "90e2c8abe05f023963bbd61ffcf7c95444d8ad676b8955328819361c9b1e9beb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93bd5b1d16707358761e499",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全没有！　我大概很少会紧张吧！\n倒不如说大舞台更让我心动呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44fbc2e9a4ea3b23b090d8b830567162e52d81b4e42bfae580429d77ac50307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dccd33a7c6f010f7c79fad3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "锻炼身体之类的！　如果一直吃甜食\n会被训练员亲骂的哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0549bac33ac7ab2ca48e3d9105014b4a5048e6b94bc31c38ac85eb31dee251d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a6384d9d491e0aee19e29e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然那个常买的牌子的包包也不错，\n但最棒的还是来自大家的～……♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "90e2c8abe05f023963bbd61ffcf7c95444d8ad676b8955328819361c9b1e9beb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb65d1c5025c19d66df2ac8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全没有！　我大概很少会紧张吧！\n倒不如说大舞台更让我心动呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44fbc2e9a4ea3b23b090d8b830567162e52d81b4e42bfae580429d77ac50307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1324b617400864068a9c378d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈！才没有什么计划啦。\\n我只是任风吹拂、自在奔跑而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "166a05083593da54a87385c792e6cf79a8313a885b3ac2b40b49444ff9fa46c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6f3477ccfbc4a0c4007f9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人！　爸爸妈妈姐姐们——！\n我，赢啦！　赢啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af1667322300ea4722f8c62879ff42af34ce1732dcad8c3fe8db9bf57985405",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1845ba1db50d97504a002b67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要多多大显身手♪\n向着闪亮名媛的梦想，冲——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca082655c7b007f7f3894abeceeba9426a72995ea6ae67640c437d97a3be443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49aa46fcad844d677fd16d39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人！　爸爸妈妈姐姐们——！\n我，赢啦！　赢啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af1667322300ea4722f8c62879ff42af34ce1732dcad8c3fe8db9bf57985405",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89ec02cd570263748c517fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之就是要多多大显身手♪\n向着闪亮名媛的梦想，冲——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca082655c7b007f7f3894abeceeba9426a72995ea6ae67640c437d97a3be443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfd85034e339b9fb56354bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是，流淌在我体内的“最强”之血……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9781a7417841c5b00364947e5f3c4d45ed73b1e79b38749afec6ede9d85c9cbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f10ec046273c8786109eac3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会重新回顾刚才的赛事。反省自身，\n是通往“最强”之路的必要习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af6018003131cc0210ef8d2975f3730c7c237fa04c772d7c8e1c50351f6c9d18",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ccbf7c33e9c4e4467771897",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我坚信，只有日积月累，\n才会让强大的实力绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf47caaf37ecab99b4602e6ea8459a14935a6aa8e8d1a67db1480cbc89074974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0f029a37024c26291a1b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……粗糙是还不成熟的表现。\n这也是到下次之前的课题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818e859a940e82c3d22d887726ee898047ce454d600b45dcd551e96b52d49191",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0741f9ef00d8c669e6ad5e1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我觉得我已经传达了……\n通过刚才的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bd3ad3e376c267cec2cc994855dc531c1b5139a2a0d1ba09c6292388901604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:054e2890dfbf00165982da49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我坚信，只有日积月累，\n才会让强大的实力绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf47caaf37ecab99b4602e6ea8459a14935a6aa8e8d1a67db1480cbc89074974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ecc98fd165ef31cbba2512",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每种场地我都很喜欢。\\n无论是翠绿的草地，还是飞溅的泥巴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d98925317c19db2d912e11c65536b4ccf8421dde10981171bdd0044f7e63f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9cd1e1f7154a56d270cd3b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……粗糙是还不成熟的表现。\n这也是到下次之前的课题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818e859a940e82c3d22d887726ee898047ce454d600b45dcd551e96b52d49191",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beedc45915bd3abd830f3bf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我觉得我已经传达了……\n通过刚才的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bd3ad3e376c267cec2cc994855dc531c1b5139a2a0d1ba09c6292388901604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:396310d74689077b5487c93a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……还要，继续累积胜利才行。\n直到能证明自己是“最强”为止……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d928b10a308f39bdbb632ab5223ca06ef04b7d8c4c1ff5e2932793ecebb43c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e89759b571b1a21baad8250",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这样啊……气槽姐她……。\n啊，这真是……不胜荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50ccc8526d3ac9915bbfed3c9dfa9807275c308a2e65274527426bc6edf7ac2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f293c1b04fcebd4e69c1be06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不……还要，继续累积胜利才行。\n直到能证明自己是“最强”为止……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d928b10a308f39bdbb632ab5223ca06ef04b7d8c4c1ff5e2932793ecebb43c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d719bbd253d989267c44fd4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这样啊……气槽姐她……。\n啊，这真是……不胜荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50ccc8526d3ac9915bbfed3c9dfa9807275c308a2e65274527426bc6edf7ac2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e52749500aa5ee4946cba6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了下一场赛事，去收集情报吧。\n……记者小姐，有什么好料吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a69021970016238d235bb821b03eb45d49989fd858c7f7e6da9d1cb0d9ad6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325d04fce95098a739652ba7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毕竟我是主播嘛。经常在镜头前说话的。\n——数码测评频道，也请多多关照哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e98793605cc754f675eae212202e7dae82f392da717457129749a77d5900c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c42bb65742d747c5dc4be2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选什么好呢，巧克力之类的甜点吧？\n感觉对大脑和身体都有好处，就吃这个了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8375fa3a0915999744f9d747fb3d047830f981b02ce7af85821f11a0c0ae69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcfe90de8731cc5295e9237",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种事，答案只有一个……当然是超级认真啦。\n——只有倾尽全力，才能创造出『未知』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46660fb1700e1eb58a32e038694b0611d8ef44cadc26747c9cbec979b9f6c45c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd712837a5fe6e8bf1f1f558",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想、想吃今天早上弄丢的面包……\\n那个……请、请发现了面包的人通知我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ee6ba22d1916d621467261596cbf298df3eb9de70cec09da3e51428a99add8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd4cd9c6e2eca0cee7fcd46d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员酱，我进决赛了哦。\n要不要给我点好跑的奖励呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "919959b5d14ea7f70e684791306926f45b8958e576b9f28658db66468c9456c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea8c4e6c7215f0c979efad8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选什么好呢，巧克力之类的甜点吧？\n感觉对大脑和身体都有好处，就吃这个了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8375fa3a0915999744f9d747fb3d047830f981b02ce7af85821f11a0c0ae69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c9f228baef4e3af68e2de46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种事，答案只有一个……当然是超级认真啦。\n——只有倾尽全力，才能创造出『未知』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46660fb1700e1eb58a32e038694b0611d8ef44cadc26747c9cbec979b9f6c45c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
